# Copy to .env for local runs (never commit .env). GitHub Actions uses the CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN secret instead.
# Every model call is Claude's, on the owner's subscription (the free models were dropped on 2026-09-24).
# Make the token with `claude setup-token`.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# Optional: the Claude model the newsroom uses (default claude-opus-5-5, Claude Opus 5.5; it needs Claude Code 2.1.280 or newer).
# Update the local Claude Code with `npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code@latest`.
# KHAZENDAR_CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
